        "TileImage": "$($repository e903a027-8c73-434d-978e-579c804480b4).Image",
        "Description": "Spooky Time.\r\r[Easter Egg Spoiler]\rFor this easter egg, you need to enter crypt as plague doctor, but also get the key from the ruins once wearing the disguise. The key is in a bottle by your feet if you start in the ruins.\r\rHowever, there is a trick. The bottle only needs to be broken, you don&apos;t actually need to pick the key up. Simply leave a breacher by the bottle, get plague doctor, and make your way to the crypt, detonating the breacher before you get there. Open door for spookiness.",
